  "description": {
   "value": "Disease evaluation for Sclerotium rolfsii Sacc. (Southern blight), a major problem in the entire field, consisted of individual assessment of plants in relation to disease symptoms at 74 DAP and harvest (111 DAP). Plants were scored on a scale from 1 to 5, where 1 was 0% of the individual plant affected, 2 (25%), 3 (50%), 4 (75%), and 5 (100% or dead).",
   "provenance_label": "EXTRACTED",
